IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `aia-definitions`
IMPORT `P5-section-5`
IMPORT `P5-art-49-annex-viii-ix`

-- Tests of Article 49 and Annexes VIII and IX (layer 1). Expected values are hand-written from the text, never from the code.
-- Dates: Chapter III Section 5 applies from 2 August 2026 (Art 113 second paragraph, keel fork F-113-groups, assumed): 1 August 2026 is before, 2 August 2026 is the day, 1 September 2027 is after.
-- Art 111(2): an AI system placed on 3 December 2027 is not saved; one placed on 1 January 2027 and not significantly changed is saved on 2 December 2030 (NOTHING), and covered if it was significantly changed.
-- Versions: the Omnibus deleted points 7 and 9 of Annex VIII Section B (27 July 2026). The group applies only from 2 August 2026, so a dispatcher's as-enacted branch is unreachable through the gate:
-- each as-enacted function is tested directly, and the dispatchers are tested on each side of 27 July 2026 (both NOTHING, before the group applies) and on the day the group applies (the amended text).

`Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` MEANS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`

§ `Article 49(1): a high-risk AI system listed in Annex III`

-- args: the four system facts, the system is listed in Annex III, the point of Annex III under which it is listed
-- Before the group applies: NOTHING.
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the registration in the EU database is required` (Date 1 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 EQUALS NOTHING
-- Point 1 on the day: the registration is required.
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the registration in the EU database is required` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the registration in the EU database is required` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 8 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Point 2: 'with the exception of high-risk AI systems referred to in point 2 of Annex III'.
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the registration in the EU database is required` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 2 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not listed in Annex III (an Annex I system): the paragraph does not speak (a scope limit with no 'only').
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the registration in the EU database is required` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): placed before the date of application of Chapter III and not significantly changed: saved (NOTHING).
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the registration in the EU database is required` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 EQUALS NOTHING
-- Covered once significantly changed.
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the registration in the EU database is required` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the registration in the EU database is required` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE 2 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- args: the four system facts, listed in Annex III, the point of Annex III, an authorised representative applies
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) who must register themselves and their system` (Date 1 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- No authorised representative: the provider.
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) who must register themselves and their system` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 FALSE EQUALS JUST `Art 49 the provider`
-- 'where applicable, the authorised representative' (fork F-49-1-rep).
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) who must register themselves and their system` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 3 TRUE EQUALS JUST `Art 49 the authorised representative`
-- Point 2: no registration is required under this paragraph.
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) who must register themselves and their system` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 2 FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) who must register themselves and their system` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) who must register themselves and their system` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) who must register themselves and their system` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 TRUE EQUALS JUST `Art 49 the authorised representative`
-- the same question put to each bearer: args are the four system facts, listed in Annex III, the point of Annex III, an authorised representative applies
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the provider must register themselves and their system` (Date 1 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- No authorised representative: the provider must register.
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the provider must register themselves and their system` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- An authorised representative applies: the provider's own duty gives way (fork F-49-1-rep).
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the provider must register themselves and their system` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Point 2: excepted.
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the provider must register themselves and their system` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 2 FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the provider must register themselves and their system` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the provider must register themselves and their system` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the provider must register themselves and their system` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the authorised representative must register themselves and the system` (Date 1 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- An authorised representative applies: the representative must register.
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the authorised representative must register themselves and the system` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- None applies: 'where applicable'.
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the authorised representative must register themselves and the system` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Point 2: excepted.
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the authorised representative must register themselves and the system` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 2 TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the authorised representative must register themselves and the system` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the authorised representative must register themselves and the system` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the authorised representative must register themselves and the system` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- args: the four system facts (the date placed is the date by which the registration is due), listed in Annex III, the point of Annex III, the registration has been made, the date on which it was made
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the registration was made before the placing on the market or the putting into service` (Date 1 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 FALSE (Date 1 1 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Registered before the placing date (3 December 2027).
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the registration was made before the placing on the market or the putting into service` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 TRUE (Date 1 9 2027) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Not registered, and the placing date has not passed: not yet breached (NOTHING).
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the registration was made before the placing on the market or the putting into service` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 FALSE (Date 1 1 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
-- On the placing date itself, not registered: a registration that day would still be in time (fork F-49-before).
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the registration was made before the placing on the market or the putting into service` (Date 3 12 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 FALSE (Date 1 1 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
-- The day after the placing date, not registered: 'Before placing on the market or putting into service'.
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the registration was made before the placing on the market or the putting into service` (Date 4 12 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 FALSE (Date 1 1 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Registered on the placing date: in time at the granularity of a day (fork F-49-before).
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the registration was made before the placing on the market or the putting into service` (Date 4 12 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 TRUE (Date 3 12 2027) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Registered the day after the placing date: late.
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the registration was made before the placing on the market or the putting into service` (Date 4 12 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 TRUE (Date 4 12 2027) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Point 2: no registration required, so no question of time.
#ASSERT `Art 49(1) the registration was made before the placing on the market or the putting into service` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 2 TRUE (Date 1 9 2027) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 49(2): an AI system the provider has concluded is not high-risk`

-- args: date asked, the provider has concluded that the AI system is not high-risk according to Article 6(3)
#ASSERT `Art 49(2) the registration in the EU database is required` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Concluded not high-risk: the registration is required.
#ASSERT `Art 49(2) the registration in the EU database is required` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 49(2) the registration in the EU database is required` (Date 1 9 2027) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- No such conclusion: the paragraph does not speak (a scope limit with no 'only').
#ASSERT `Art 49(2) the registration in the EU database is required` (Date 1 9 2027) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- args: date asked, concluded not high-risk, an authorised representative applies
#ASSERT `Art 49(2) who must register themselves and the AI system` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 49(2) who must register themselves and the AI system` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST `Art 49 the provider`
#ASSERT `Art 49(2) who must register themselves and the AI system` (Date 1 9 2027) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST `Art 49 the authorised representative`
#ASSERT `Art 49(2) who must register themselves and the AI system` (Date 1 9 2027) FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- args: date asked, concluded not high-risk, the date the AI system is to be placed on the market, the registration has been made, the date on which it was made
#ASSERT `Art 49(2) the registration was made before the placing on the market or the putting into service` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE (Date 1 1 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 49(2) the registration was made before the placing on the market or the putting into service` (Date 1 9 2027) TRUE (Date 3 12 2027) TRUE (Date 1 9 2027) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 49(2) the registration was made before the placing on the market or the putting into service` (Date 1 9 2027) TRUE (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE (Date 1 1 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 49(2) the registration was made before the placing on the market or the putting into service` (Date 4 12 2027) TRUE (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE (Date 1 1 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 49(2) the registration was made before the placing on the market or the putting into service` (Date 4 12 2027) TRUE (Date 3 12 2027) TRUE (Date 3 12 2027) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 49(2) the registration was made before the placing on the market or the putting into service` (Date 4 12 2027) TRUE (Date 3 12 2027) TRUE (Date 4 12 2027) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 49(2) the registration was made before the placing on the market or the putting into service` (Date 1 9 2027) FALSE (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE (Date 1 1 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
-- the same question put to each bearer: args are date asked, concluded not high-risk, an authorised representative applies
#ASSERT `Art 49(2) the provider must register themselves and the AI system` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 49(2) the provider must register themselves and the AI system` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- An authorised representative applies: the provider's own duty gives way (fork F-49-1-rep).
#ASSERT `Art 49(2) the provider must register themselves and the AI system` (Date 1 9 2027) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 49(2) the provider must register themselves and the AI system` (Date 1 9 2027) FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 49(2) the authorised representative must register themselves and the AI system` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 49(2) the authorised representative must register themselves and the AI system` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- None applies: 'where applicable'.
#ASSERT `Art 49(2) the authorised representative must register themselves and the AI system` (Date 1 9 2027) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 49(2) the authorised representative must register themselves and the AI system` (Date 1 9 2027) FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 49(3): deployers that are public authorities`

-- args: the four system facts, listed in Annex III, the point of Annex III, the deployer is a public authority, a Union institution, body, office or agency, or a person acting on their behalf
#ASSERT `Art 49(3) the deployer must register themselves, select the system and register its use in the EU database` (Date 1 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- A public authority deploying a point 1 system.
#ASSERT `Art 49(3) the deployer must register themselves, select the system and register its use in the EU database` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Point 2: 'with the exception of high-risk AI systems listed in point 2 of Annex III'.
#ASSERT `Art 49(3) the deployer must register themselves, select the system and register its use in the EU database` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 2 TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A deployer that is not a public authority and so on: 'deployers that are public authorities ...' (a scope limit with no 'only').
#ASSERT `Art 49(3) the deployer must register themselves, select the system and register its use in the EU database` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Not listed in Annex III.
#ASSERT `Art 49(3) the deployer must register themselves, select the system and register its use in the EU database` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Saved by Art 111(2).
#ASSERT `Art 49(3) the deployer must register themselves, select the system and register its use in the EU database` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Covered once significantly changed.
#ASSERT `Art 49(3) the deployer must register themselves, select the system and register its use in the EU database` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- args: the four system facts, listed, point, public authority, the date the deployer puts the system into service or uses it, the registration has been made, the date on which it was made
#ASSERT `Art 49(3) the registration was made before the putting into service or the use` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 TRUE (Date 3 12 2027) TRUE (Date 1 9 2027) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Not yet registered, the date has not passed.
#ASSERT `Art 49(3) the registration was made before the putting into service or the use` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 TRUE (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE (Date 1 1 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 49(3) the registration was made before the putting into service or the use` (Date 4 12 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 TRUE (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE (Date 1 1 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 49(3) the registration was made before the putting into service or the use` (Date 4 12 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 TRUE (Date 3 12 2027) TRUE (Date 3 12 2027) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Not a public authority: no duty.
#ASSERT `Art 49(3) the registration was made before the putting into service or the use` (Date 4 12 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 FALSE (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE (Date 1 1 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 49(3) the registration was made before the putting into service or the use` (Date 1 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 TRUE (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE (Date 1 1 2026) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 49(4): the secure non-public section`

-- the group: args are the point of Annex III and the areas fact
-- Point 1, in the areas: in the group.
#ASSERT `Art 49(4) the high-risk AI system is one of those referred to in points 1, 6 and 7 of Annex III in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management` 1 TRUE
-- Point 6, in the areas: in the group.
#ASSERT `Art 49(4) the high-risk AI system is one of those referred to in points 1, 6 and 7 of Annex III in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management` 6 TRUE
-- Point 7, in the areas: in the group.
#ASSERT `Art 49(4) the high-risk AI system is one of those referred to in points 1, 6 and 7 of Annex III in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management` 7 TRUE
-- Point 2 in the areas: not in the group.
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 49(4) the high-risk AI system is one of those referred to in points 1, 6 and 7 of Annex III in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management` 2 TRUE)
-- Point 3 in the areas: not in the group.
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 49(4) the high-risk AI system is one of those referred to in points 1, 6 and 7 of Annex III in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management` 3 TRUE)
-- Point 6 outside the areas: not in the group.
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 49(4) the high-risk AI system is one of those referred to in points 1, 6 and 7 of Annex III in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management` 6 FALSE)
-- Point 1 outside the areas: not in the group.
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 49(4) the high-risk AI system is one of those referred to in points 1, 6 and 7 of Annex III in the areas of law enforcement, migration, asylum and border control management` 1 FALSE)
-- args: date asked, the point of Annex III, the areas fact
#ASSERT `Art 49(4) the registration must be in a secure non-public section of the EU database` (Date 1 8 2026) 6 TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Point 6 in the areas: the secure non-public section.
#ASSERT `Art 49(4) the registration must be in a secure non-public section of the EU database` (Date 2 8 2026) 6 TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 49(4) the registration must be in a secure non-public section of the EU database` (Date 1 9 2027) 1 TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 49(4) the registration must be in a secure non-public section of the EU database` (Date 1 9 2027) 7 TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Point 2 is not one of points 1, 6 and 7: the paragraph does not speak.
#ASSERT `Art 49(4) the registration must be in a secure non-public section of the EU database` (Date 1 9 2027) 2 TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Not in the areas: NOTHING.
#ASSERT `Art 49(4) the registration must be in a secure non-public section of the EU database` (Date 1 9 2027) 6 FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the points of each Annex: 'shall include only the following information': listed, JUST TRUE; not listed, JUST FALSE (the list is closed with 'only'); not a point of the Annex, NOTHING
-- Section A, point 1: listed ('points 1 to 10, with the exception of points 6, 8 and 9').
#ASSERT `Art 49(4)(a) the Section A point is within the restricted registration` 1 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 49(4)(a) the Section A point is within the restricted registration` 2 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 49(4)(a) the Section A point is within the restricted registration` 3 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 49(4)(a) the Section A point is within the restricted registration` 4 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 49(4)(a) the Section A point is within the restricted registration` 5 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 49(4)(a) the Section A point is within the restricted registration` 7 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 49(4)(a) the Section A point is within the restricted registration` 10 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Section A, point 6: excepted.
#ASSERT `Art 49(4)(a) the Section A point is within the restricted registration` 6 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 49(4)(a) the Section A point is within the restricted registration` 8 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 49(4)(a) the Section A point is within the restricted registration` 9 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Section A, point 11: beyond point 10, so not listed.
