§ `Article 49 and Annexes VIII and IX: the regulative rules`

-- Articles 49(1) to (3) state a time limit (before placing on the market, putting into service or use), so those rules have a breach path. Time 0 of a trace is the date asked; the limit is the days from the date asked to the
-- date of placing on the market (3 December 2027): from 1 September 2027 that is 93 days. The other rules state no time limit and no consequence: no breach path (NOTES.md, Rules with no breach path (P5)).
-- Before the group applies: nothing is owed.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 49(1) the duty to register before placing on the market or putting into service` (Date 1 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 49(1) the duty to register before placing on the market or putting into service` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 49(1) register themselves and their system in the EU database` AT 5
-- On the last day (day 93): in time.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 49(1) the duty to register before placing on the market or putting into service` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 49(1) register themselves and their system in the EU database` AT 93
-- One day late.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 49(1) the duty to register before placing on the market or putting into service` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 49(1) register themselves and their system in the EU database` AT 94
-- Nothing done and the limit passed.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 49(1) the duty to register before placing on the market or putting into service` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 100
-- Where an authorised representative applies the representative registers.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 49(1) the duty to register before placing on the market or putting into service` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Authorised representative` DOES `Art 49(1) register themselves and their system in the EU database` AT 5
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 49(1) the duty to register before placing on the market or putting into service` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 100
-- Point 2: nothing is owed under this paragraph.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 49(1) the duty to register before placing on the market or putting into service` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 2 FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 49(1) the duty to register before placing on the market or putting into service` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- Saved by Art 111(2).
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 49(1) the duty to register before placing on the market or putting into service` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- A date asked after the date of placing: the limit has passed, so any trace reads BREACH (the function 'was made before' answers instead).
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 49(1) the duty to register before placing on the market or putting into service` (Date 4 12 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 49(1) register themselves and their system in the EU database` AT 0
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 49(2) the duty to register before placing on the market or putting into service` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE FALSE (Date 3 12 2027) AT 0 WITH
