§ `Seam S14: Article 2(2) and a high-risk AI system with Section B products`

-- Article 2(2): for a high-risk AI system under Article 6(1) related to products covered by the legislation listed in Section B of Annex I, only Article 6(1), Article 60a and Articles 102 to 112 apply.
-- So on route Article 6(1) with Annex I, with Section B products TRUE and a date from 2 February 2025, each function below answers JUST FALSE (a function that is not a yes or no answer: NOTHING; a regulative rule: FULFILLED),
-- whatever the date asked is against Chapter III's date and whatever Art 111(2) says. On the Annex III route the Section B fact changes nothing.
-- Cut off by Article 2(2): JUST FALSE.
